    "module_designation": "Not applicable",
    "description": "Digital indicating device designated DPS-800s indicator with optional labeller connected to a weighing platform to form a Class III or IIII, mains-powered self-indicating, non-automatic weighing instrument. May be used for direct sales to the public. Devices: initial zero setting, semi-automatic zero setting, zero tracking, semi-automatic subtractive tare weighing, determination of stability of equilibrium, indication of stability of equilibrium, zero indicator, PLUs, preset tare, price calculation. Interfaces: load cell 6-wire shielded connection, Ethernet, USB, RS232. Stainless steel enclosure with metallic supporting frame. Load cells: any compatible load cell(s) with a valid OIML R60 Certificate of Conformity, compatibility established via compatibility of modules calculation."
